WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Cryptococcal meningitis: can one dose of AmBisome replace a week of toxic infusions?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
AMBITION-cm randomized 844 participants adults with HIV-associated cryptococcal meningitis.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Ten-week mortality: 24.8% with one dose of AmBisome versus 28.7% with the WHO standard.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Difference −3.9%, with the upper confidence limit far inside the 10% margin. Noninferior.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Severe anemia: 13.3% versus 39.1%.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Blood transfusions: 7.6% versus 18.0%.

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Single-dose AmBisome was noninferior and safer. N Engl J Med, 2022. Scroll for the full breakdown.
